    "updated_at": "2019-09-30T18:58:51Z",
    "body": "Exactly what @chipbuster said. I only need to know the the directory contains python scripts or javascript files for example. I don't need to to display which version of python or node is installed on my system since it is always the same.\r\n\r\nSome modules make sense to show the version such as the `[package]` module where the version will be different per project which is why a per module config option would be most useful.\r\n\r\nMy end goal would be just to show the icons lined up for the detected type like [🐍💎⬢] which would first require other features that have already been suggested such as https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/418 or https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/346",
